1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,000
今冬加州只数到1.2万只
Just over 12,000 western monarchs this winter.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
比1997年少了99%
99% fewer than in 1997.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,500
2020年只剩1,901只
By 2020: just 1,901.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:11,500
就这样没了？
Was that the end?

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,500
第二年冬天回来了24.7万只
Next winter: 247,000 came back.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,000
一年之间多了130倍
130 times as many, in a single year.

7
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,500
可惜没守住2024年不到1万
But it didn't last: under 10,000 by 2024.

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,600
60多处越冬地已被毁掉
Over 60 of their winter roost sites have been destroyed.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,500
它们回得来
They can come back.

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,000
前提是越冬林还在
If they still have somewhere to spend the winter.
